+// speak, the identity clause proves the recipe the row evaluates IS the product: every resident
+// `d` equals the shipped arm's recipe, spelled HERE from `74a2b5d9`'s `generateCellRects` (HEAD)
+// and MRK-ABS's recipe (the graft), never imported from the product.
