+// a touch 1–3px off the sheet at the sheet, so the clause bears the load and its cut reds the row.
+// At 16×16 it aims the same touches at the cell under them (all of 1–10px below at 390×844 and 1–6px
+// right at 390×664 read `cell` with NO_BOTTOM or NO_RIGHT cut), so there is no band to cure there:
+// the 16×16 rows gate the reach and PRINT their negative, which no cut of this clause can red.
