+ *                     content, whatever the sidecar says. Its live twin is `e2e/tab-pen.spec.ts`.
+ *
+ * `--self-test` plants defects in memory; each must RED exactly its clause set (and the check ids it
+ * names), and the negative-negatives must stay GREEN. `--sabotage-battery` switches each check off in
+ * turn, and each of the library clauses this gate reads, and the self-test must red every time.
+ * Every numeric bound lives in BOUNDS (or WINDOWS) and is pinned by an EDGE plant each side;
+ * `--threshold-battery` moves each bound by its ε, loosened and tightened, and every move must red.
+ * Run: `node scripts/check-favicon.mjs [--self-test | --sabotage-battery | --threshold-battery]
